WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.233
Right now,

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:01.067
the US State Department

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.701
is working

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.203
to try to verify

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.971
or disprove notorious Russian

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.841
Wagner warlord Yevgeny Prigozhin claim

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:08.808
that a US

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.243
citizen was killed fighting in back.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.278
Moute Prigozhin posted a video

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.147
seeming to inspect the dead

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.148
soldiers body.

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.583
He then showed what he claimed was

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.717
an American ID.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:18.718
The US State Department

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.186
has not yet confirmed

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.121
that an American died.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:21.921
In fact,

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.223
most prigozhin says

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.090
that he will hand the body

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.891
over to the US

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:26.593
and treat the corpse with respect

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.528
for dying and quote, worthy death.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.030
Meanwhile, just outside of Kiev,

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.697
one of Ukraine's

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.965
two US made patriot

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.566
air defense systems

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.001
may be out of commission after

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:35.568
Russia claimed

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.037
it hit the billion dollar battery

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.305
with a, quote, high precision strike.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:39.639
And U.S.

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:40.573
officials are now

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.608
acknowledging that

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:43.043
it is probably damage, though

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.611
they say it is not destroyed.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.012
The US says the highly effective

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:46.913
defense system

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.882
might need to be pulled back or repaired,

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.983
taking one out of commission

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.751
even for a short time, of course,

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.352
could impact

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:53.253
Ukraine's ability

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.522
to defend its capital of Kiev,

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.790
seen in some highly

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.324
reports for us now from southeastern

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:58.992
Ukraine as Russia

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.360
is trying to find holes

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.694
in Ukraine's defenses,

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.063
which have been fortified

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:06.433
with a steady stream of Western aid.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.568
A new Russian tactic in

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.170
the air assault against key

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:15.542
concentrated fire by missiles and drones,

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.310
testing Ukraine's air

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.313
defenses, probing for weaknesses in

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.150
Ukraine, says it shot down 18 missiles,

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.351
including six

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.954
Kinzel, Russia's hypersonic weapon.

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:29.222
It was once

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.458
considered invulnerable to air defenses.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:36.362
Now not so much she kills.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.631
Six of these missiles were fired

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.400
in the direction of the capital.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.436
They were all destroyed by air defense.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.271
Russia has been trying to overwhelm

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:49.042
Ukraine with air attacks for months.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.043
The results, though,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.978
have been more pledges of air defenses

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.046
from the US

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:54.481
and especially the UK

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.648
and now even Germany.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.551
After months of holding back.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.419
On the ground

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.421
the conflict grinds on in bafflement.

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.890
Did any of those up on the television

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.191
any of us feel

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.394
Bognor mercenary leader Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.530
releasing a new video purporting

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.332
to show him in the city.

00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:15.001
He demonstrates uncharacteristic sympathy

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.504
for an alleged American volunteer

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:20.440
killed fighting for Ukraine, urging

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:22.542
we will hand him over

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:22.742
to the

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.444
United States of America,

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:25.778
will put him in a coffin,

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.480
cover him with the American flag

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.381
with respect,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.816
because he did not die in his bed

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:30.884
as a grandpa,

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.285
but he died at war

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:35.021
and most likely a worthy death.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.224
So recap The Washington Post has reported

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:40.426
that US intelligence documents

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.529
suggest that he tried to trade

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.230
Russian intelligence

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.532
for seeding territory

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:46.900
around parliament,

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.101
yet he subsequently

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.270
Prigozhin denies the claims.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.971
Russia's said that the allegations

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:52.605
Prigozhin

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:56.509
offered to spy for Ukraine are a hoax,

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:57.677
but in the Kremlin

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.180
they might one day be considered treason,

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:01.714
making this town

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:04.350
perhaps a safer place than Moscow

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:08.221
for Russia's top mercenary.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:12.992
Now, Jake,

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:15.495
the Kremlin has said that

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.531
they didn't fire six hypersonic

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.065
missiles,

00:03:19.065 --> 00:03:20.900
so the Ukrainians couldn't have shot

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.901
that many down.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:25.171
They deny, indeed, that any of their 18

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.006
cruise missiles

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.274
kind of a cruise missiles,

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.243
the hypersonic

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.178
missiles and indeed more traditional

00:03:32.178 --> 00:03:33.813
missiles were shot down.

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.848
They say they all reached their target.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:37.617
Now, the Ukrainians historically

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:38.551
have been pretty accurate

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.352
about the missiles

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.753
that they've shot down,

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:42.722
but they tend not to confirm

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.691
whether or not the other missiles

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:45.391
have actually made

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.827
their target, particularly if they're not

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.862
if they are rather a military target

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.798
such as Patriot batteries Jake.

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:53.166
All right, Sam Kiley in Ukraine for us,

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.434
thank you so much.

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.501
The Chinese government

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.803
is dispatching its envoy

00:03:56.803 --> 00:03:58.471
and former ambassador to Russia

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:01.574
Lee Highway to Ukraine this week,

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:02.675
as well as to Poland

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:03.910
and to France and to Germany

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.278
and to Russia.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:07.380
They say this is an effort to move toward

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.650
a Beijing mediated peace talk.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:12.986
And joining us now

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:13.953
for a bipartisan interview,

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:15.555
the top members of the Select Committee

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:16.990
on China, Republican Chairman

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.391
Mike Gallagher of Wisconsin,

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:19.859
and Democratic ranking member

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:20.593
Congressman Raja

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.262
Krishnamoorthi of Illinois.

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.096
Chairman Gallagher,

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:23.830
let me start with you.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:25.698
How realistic or unrealistic is it?

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.967
Do you think, for China to try to broker

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:29.702
any sort of peace deal?

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:32.071
Do they have the standing to do so?

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:32.672
They do not,

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:35.308
because, of course, China is fueling

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:37.143
Putin's war machine.

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:40.280
China is standing by Vladimir Putin.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.114
Xi and Putin have a

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:42.282
no limits partnership.

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:43.516
And I think it's important

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:44.751
for us to understand

00:04:44.751 --> 00:04:45.351
the depths

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:47.420
and the scale of this partnership.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.022
And for that

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:51.691
to give us the energy

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.192
to continue our support

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:54.127
of the Ukrainians,

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:55.395
to make sure that we're modernizing

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.629
our defense industrial base

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:57.764
to build the weapons that we need

00:04:57.764 --> 00:04:58.998
not only to help Ukrainians

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:00.033
fight for themselves,

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.634
but to replenish our stockpiles,

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:03.002
as well as provide weapons

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:04.437
in the Indo-Pacific.

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.272
And so let's not allow

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:07.640
the Chinese Communist Party

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.641
to perpetuate this narrative

00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:09.742
that somehow they're

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:11.477
peacemakers when they are,

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:13.513
in fact, supporting Putin's war machine.

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:15.848
So even beyond that, Congressman

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:16.916
Krishnamoorthi, Ukraine's

00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:17.850
President Zelensky,

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.651
he's made it clear that

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:20.286
he will not accept any peace deal

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:21.521
without liberating

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:22.689
the entirety of Ukraine,

00:05:22.689 --> 00:05:23.756
including Crimea,

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:26.659
which Russia illegally annexed in 2014.

00:05:26.693 --> 00:05:28.127
So I wonder if there is even

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.762
a peace deal to be had.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.732
Well, it's certainly not the

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.033
the Chinese peace deal,

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:35.868
which I think the 13 point plan

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.370
still recognizes

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.439
Russian aggression in Ukraine.

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:41.874
By recognizing their claims

00:05:41.874 --> 00:05:42.975
to Ukrainian land,

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:43.810
unless they call

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.012
for a pullback of those troops,

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.281
there's not going to be any peace deal.

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:48.915
Jeremy Gallagher,

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:50.149
I have to just ask you,

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:51.017
in terms of Ukraine,

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.118
I mean, we've heard some

00:05:52.118 --> 00:05:53.653
pretty wobbly comments from Trump,

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:55.488
DeSantis, even Speaker McCarthy

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:57.690
when it comes to supporting Ukraine

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.492
in what is not to overstate

00:05:59.492 --> 00:06:00.593
it, an existential threat

00:06:00.593 --> 00:06:02.929
to its existence as a democracy.

00:06:02.929 --> 00:06:04.664
Does that make your job harder?

00:06:04.664 --> 00:06:06.399
Obviously, you are

00:06:06.399 --> 00:06:07.934
pretty forthright

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:09.168
in your expressions of support

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.103
for Ukraine.

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:10.436
Well,

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:11.104
I think we need to do

00:06:11.104 --> 00:06:12.672
a better job, really, for those of us

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:13.706
who are also advocating

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:15.908
for an investment in defense more broadly

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:17.310
of really explaining

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.177
what we're up against

00:06:18.177 --> 00:06:18.644
in the form

00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:19.879
of the Chinese Communist Party

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:22.281
and how you can isolate the Russia threat

00:06:22.281 --> 00:06:24.517
from this broader no limits partnership.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.385
What I increasingly see

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.452
is a de facto alliance

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:28.087
against the West in terms of Xi, Putin

00:06:28.087 --> 00:06:30.323
and to a lesser extent the Iranians.

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:32.091
So teasing out the depth

00:06:32.091 --> 00:06:32.992
of that partnership

00:06:32.992 --> 00:06:34.260
is one part of the effort.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.062
The other thing is

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.029
really understanding

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:39.198
what the crisis in Ukraine has revealed,

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:41.334
which is just the fragility

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:41.968
of our defense

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:42.969
industrial base,

00:06:42.969 --> 00:06:44.370
our munitions industrial base,

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:44.871
and making sure

00:06:44.871 --> 00:06:45.838
that we never put ourselves

00:06:45.838 --> 00:06:46.873
in this position again

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:48.775
where we're struggling to manufacture

00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:50.343
things that we've neglected for years.

00:06:50.343 --> 00:06:52.245
So we can fix that problem

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:52.678
through things

00:06:52.678 --> 00:06:54.247
like multiyear procurement

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:56.282
for critical long range precision fires.

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:57.116
But that requires

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:58.584
some action here on Capitol Hill.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.620
Congressman Krishnamoorthi Zelenskiy

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.054
reiterated his desire for U.S.

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:03.923
made F-16 fighter jets.

00:07:03.923 --> 00:07:04.157
U.S.

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:05.658
officials are constantly saying

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:07.026
they're reluctant to send Ukraine weapons

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:08.594
that can strike inside Russian borders.

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:11.731
But Ukraine, we know, now has British

00:07:11.731 --> 00:07:12.465
stealth missiles

00:07:12.465 --> 00:07:14.967
that have 155 mile range.

00:07:14.967 --> 00:07:16.436
So I don't really fully understand

00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:16.936
the argument

00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:18.871
because they have the

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:20.339
ability to hit inside Russia.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:21.941
I personally

00:07:21.941 --> 00:07:22.308
think that

00:07:22.308 --> 00:07:22.975
it's a good idea

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:25.044
to provide those weapons.

00:07:25.711 --> 00:07:27.780
I do think that one other thing

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.781
that we should mention

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:30.249
is that we are trying to work

00:07:30.249 --> 00:07:30.950
with our allies

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:31.417
and partners

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:31.951
in the region

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.753
to provide them with the armaments

00:07:33.753 --> 00:07:34.987
they require.

00:07:34.987 --> 00:07:36.389
I think that we should provide them

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:38.057
with the attack EMS as well,

00:07:38.057 --> 00:07:39.659
which is the long range missile,

00:07:39.659 --> 00:07:41.461
which is one

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:42.795
one step higher

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:43.196
than what

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.831
we have provided with the high marks.

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:45.431
What we've learned

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:47.300
is that the Russians are moving back

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.035
their outposts and targets

00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:50.603
beyond the range of the high MA.

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:51.704
So it's logical

00:07:51.704 --> 00:07:52.939
to provide the Ukrainians

00:07:52.939 --> 00:07:55.508
with the next level weapon to be able to

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.945
deter attacks from those

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:01.848
and to punish attacks coming from those

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:03.216
further regions.

